    {
        "content": "<p>the problem is that those positions are dependent, they show up in the type of a term</p>",
        "id": 584191400,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1775644215
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>in general in order to do that you would have to cast terms from one type to another</p>",
        "id": 584191476,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1775644250
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><code>simp</code> can rewrite arguments with forward dependencies only using <code>dsimp</code> theorems i.e. those provable by <code>rfl</code></p>",
